# Source drops for the image pipeline; the WebP output is what ships.
# Ignore the files, not the directories: git will not look inside an excluded
# directory, so "incoming/**" made the README negation below unreachable and
# quietly dropped the drop instructions from the repo.
incoming/**/*
!incoming/**/
!incoming/**/README.md
